---
code: dangling-reference
when-fires: a coordinate resolved DANGLING (no such entity on an enumerable kind). cli/survival.rs dangling_diagnostics. `{coord}` = the rendered coordinate.
why: 24F §4: turns a third-party-typo from silent value-loss into a pointed hint; the coord rides the may-alias degrade (the site runs). ADVISORY (fail toward run).
---
-- book.sh --
#!/bin/sh
apt-get install nginx
apt-get install nginx-full

-- package.oracle.sh --
#!/usr/bin/env dorc-sh
# dorc-lang/v0.2
apt_get__predict() {
   while [ "${1#-}" != "$1" ]; do shift; done
   verb=$1; shift
   while [ "${1#-}" != "$1" ]; do shift; done
   pkg : sm.dorc.Package = "$1"
   if [ "${2-}" = "" ]; then
      case $verb in
         install) dpkg-query -W "$pkg" >/dev/null 2>&1 : sm.dorc.Package:"$pkg"@installed ;;
      esac
   fi
}
apt_get__is_converged() {
   while [ "${1#-}" != "$1" ]; do shift; done
   verb=$1; shift
   while [ "${1#-}" != "$1" ]; do shift; done
   case $verb in install) dpkg-query -W "$1" >/dev/null 2>&1 ;; *) return 2 ;; esac
}
sm_dorc_Package__resolve() { dpkg-query -W -f '${Package}\n' -- "$1"; }

-- probe-results.txt --
site 0 effect=absent rc=1
site 1 effect=holds rc=0
resolv sm.dorc.Package:nginx dangling
resolv sm.dorc.Package:nginx-full canon=nginx-full

-- replay --
$ dorc plan --book=book.sh --pre-source package.oracle.sh --risk-faultless-skips --results - < probe-results.txt > /dev/null
resolve: note[dangling-reference]: Coordinate sm.dorc.Package:nginx names an
entity its kind's resolver does not recognize -- a likely typo or stale name --
so Dorc treats it as possibly aliasing anything, and the site runs.
why: site 1 guard [sm.dorc.Package] -- licensed by the sm.dorc.Package oracle's vouch (at package.oracle.sh:18) that it is already satisfied; the original bytes survive and the check re-runs live at apply (to stay safe)
dorc: run `dorc why` for the per-site cause-chains, or `dorc why book.sh:N` to query a source line
dorc: plan-summary sites=2 elide=0 omit=0 guard=1 run=1 may-alias=0
dorc: decision-digest 72571aede05043ea

$ dorc-loom --this vars
case: dangling-reference
{{coord}} = "sm.dorc.Package:nginx"
{{v0}} = "book.sh"
{{v1}} = "0"
{{v2}} = "0"
{{v3}} = "1"
{{v4}} = "1"
{{v5}} = "0"
